# The Infernal Deep: a volcanic cavern re-authored to the Canyon Terrain kit's
# 4-unit scale, so the warm basalt pieces clad the open hall cleanly. A sunken
# lava lake glows at its heart (a sector on the lava tileset, through the
# emission channel), ringed by rock ledges and pillar islands, with the
# demon-lord's altar across the fire. 1=wall, 0=open floor.
map INFERNAL
size 20 16
tileset 15
music 0
area infernal
# the cavern stands about four units tall; the lava lake sinks over a unit and
# rides the lava tileset (16), so its floor glows molten
sector 0 0 64
sector 1 -20 64 16
walls
11111111111111111111
10000000000000000001
10000000000000000001
10001100000000110001
10001100000000110001
10000000000000000001
10000000000000000001
10000000000000000001
10000000000000000001
10000000000000000001
10001100000000110001
10001100000000110001
10000000000000000001
10000000000000000001
10000000000000000001
11111111111111111111
end
# the central lava lake
fill 1 7 6 12 9
marker start 2 13 N
marker back 2 2 S
portal 2 14 DUNGEON back
npc 10 2 DEMONLORD Altar NPC_ALTAR
# the lava lake burns those who wade into it, and lights the cavern around it
trigger hazard 4 fire 7 6 12 6 12 9 7 9
trigger ambient 120 - 7 6 12 6 12 9 7 9
trap 4 12 10 13 fire
trap 16 12 10 13 fire
gasvent 4 6
gasvent 15 6
bonfire 2 12
prop 3 13 BARREL
loot 3 13 200 HARMOR 1
